sequenceDiagram
    actor R as Recruiter
    participant UI as Dashboard
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant DB as SQLite
    participant PAR as Resume parsers
    participant MOD as Local embedding model
    R->>UI: Create job with structured requirements
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/openings
    API->>DB: Store opening
    R->>UI: Upload resume for application
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/resumes/upload
    API->>DB: Store processing job
    API-->>UI: 202 + job_id
    API->>PAR: Extract and structure resume
    PAR->>DB: Save text and parsed profile
    R->>UI: Request candidate score
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/candidates/score
    API->>DB: Load candidate and opening
    API->>MOD: Encode sanitized resume and job text
    MOD-->>API: Embeddings
    API->>DB: Save score and evidence
    API-->>UI: Score, components, warnings, rank
